        "content": "## 1. Insiemi, parametri e variabili decisionali\n\n### Insiemi\n\n- Progetti:\n  \\[\n  P=\\{A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,I,J,K,L\\}.\n  \\]\n- Anni:\n  \\[\n  T=\\{1,2,3\\}.\n  \\]\n- Progetti digitali:\n  \\[\n  P^{dig}=\\{A,C,G,J\\}.\n  \\]\n- Progetti sostenibili:\n  \\[\n  P^{sost}=\\{E,H,K\\}.\n  \\]\n- Relazioni di precedenza, nella forma (progetto, requisito):\n  \\[\n  R=\\{(G,B),(J,E),(K,C)\\}.\n  \\]\n- Coppie incompatibili:\n  \\[\n  U=\\{\\{D,H\\},\\{F,L\\}\\}.\n  \\]\n- Coppie con sinergia:\n  \\[\n  S=\\{(A,C),(E,K)\\}.\n  \\]\n\n### Parametri\n\nNell’ordine \\(A,B,\\ldots,L\\):\n\n\\[\n(v_i)=(42,35,48,31,40,28,55,37,33,50,46,29),\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(c_{i1})=(18,20,25,15,22,14,30,20,17,27,24,16),\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(c_{i2})=(12,18,20,14,16,12,25,18,15,21,19,13),\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(c_{i3})=(10,14,18,12,15,10,22,16,12,18,17,11),\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(p_i)=(4,4,5,3,4,3,6,4,3,5,5,3),\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(r_i)=(5,4,6,3,4,2,7,5,3,6,5,3).\n\\]\n\nBudget annuali:\n\n\\[\n(B_1,B_2,B_3)=(110,100,90).\n\\]\n\nLimiti complessivi:\n\n\\[\nP^{\\max}=28,\\qquad R^{\\max}=32,\\qquad N^{\\max}=8.\n\\]\n\nBonus di sinergia:\n\n\\[\ns_{AC}=12,\\qquad s_{EK}=10.\n\\]\n\n### Variabili decisionali\n\nPer ogni \\(i\\in P\\):\n\n\\[\nx_i=\n\\begin{cases}\n1 & \\text{se il progetto }i\\text{ viene selezionato},\\\\\n0 & \\text{altrimenti}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\nVariabili esplicite di sinergia:\n\n\\[\ny_{AC}=\n\\begin{cases}\n1 & \\text{se sia }A\\text{ sia }C\\text{ sono selezionati},\\\\\n0 & \\text{altrimenti},\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\n\\[\ny_{EK}=\n\\begin{cases}\n1 & \\text{se sia }E\\text{ sia }K\\text{ sono selezionati},\\\\\n0 & \\text{altrimenti}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n## 2. Formulazione matematica completa\n\n### Funzione obiettivo\n\n\\[\n\\max\\quad\n\\sum_{i\\in P} v_i x_i+12y_{AC}+10y_{EK}.\n\\]\n\n### Budget annuali\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in P}c_{i1}x_i\\leq 110,\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in P}c_{i2}x_i\\leq 100,\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in P}c_{i3}x_i\\leq 90.\n\\]\n\n### Personale e rischio\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in P}p_i x_i\\leq 28,\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in P}r_i x_i\\leq 32.\n\\]\n\n### Requisiti tra progetti\n\n\\[\nx_G\\leq x_B,\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx_J\\leq x_E,\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx_K\\leq x_C.\n\\]\n\n### Incompatibilità\n\n\\[\nx_D+x_H\\leq 1,\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx_F+x_L\\leq 1.\n\\]\n\n### Requisiti strategici\n\nAlmeno due progetti digitali:\n\n\\[\nx_A+x_C+x_G+x_J\\geq 2.\n\\]\n\nAlmeno un progetto sostenibile:\n\n\\[\nx_E+x_H+x_K\\geq 1.\n\\]\n\nAl massimo otto progetti:\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in P}x_i\\leq 8.\n\\]\n\n### Linearizzazione delle sinergie\n\nPer la coppia \\(A-C\\):\n\n\\[\ny_{AC}\\leq x_A,\n\\qquad\ny_{AC}\\leq x_C,\n\\qquad\ny_{AC}\\geq x_A+x_C-1.\n\\]\n\nPer la coppia \\(E-K\\):\n\n\\[\ny_{EK}\\leq x_E,\n\\qquad\ny_{EK}\\leq x_K,\n\\qquad\ny_{EK}\\geq x_E+x_K-1.\n\\]\n\n### Dominio\n\n\\[\nx_i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\forall i\\in P,\n\\]\n\n\\[\ny_{AC},y_{EK}\\in\\{0,1\\}.\n\\]\n\n---\n\n## 3. Codice Python eseguibile con Gurobi\n\n```python\nimport gurobipy as gp\nfrom gurobipy import GRB\nimport json\n\nP = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\", \"F\", \"G\", \"H\", \"I\", \"J\", \"K\", \"L\"]\nT = [1, 2, 3]\n\nvan = {\n    \"A\": 42, \"B\": 35, \"C\": 48, \"D\": 31,\n    \"E\": 40, \"F\": 28, \"G\": 55, \"H\": 37,\n    \"I\": 33, \"J\": 50, \"K\": 46, \"L\": 29\n}\n\ncost = {\n    \"A\": {1: 18, 2: 12, 3: 10},\n    \"B\": {1: 20, 2: 18, 3: 14},\n    \"C\": {1: 25, 2: 20, 3: 18},\n    \"D\": {1: 15, 2: 14, 3: 12},\n    \"E\": {1: 22, 2: 16, 3: 15},\n    \"F\": {1: 14, 2: 12, 3: 10},\n    \"G\": {1: 30, 2: 25, 3: 22},\n    \"H\": {1: 20, 2: 18, 3: 16},\n    \"I\": {1: 17, 2: 15, 3: 12},\n    \"J\": {1: 27, 2: 21, 3: 18},\n    \"K\": {1: 24, 2: 19, 3: 17},\n    \"L\": {1: 16, 2: 13, 3: 11}\n}\n\npersonnel = {\n    \"A\": 4, \"B\": 4, \"C\": 5, \"D\": 3,\n    \"E\": 4, \"F\": 3, \"G\": 6, \"H\": 4,\n    \"I\": 3, \"J\": 5, \"K\": 5, \"L\": 3\n}\n\nrisk = {\n    \"A\": 5, \"B\": 4, \"C\": 6, \"D\": 3,\n    \"E\": 4, \"F\": 2, \"G\": 7, \"H\": 5,\n    \"I\": 3, \"J\": 6, \"K\": 5, \"L\": 3\n}\n\nbudget = {1: 110, 2: 100, 3: 90}\ndigital = [\"A\", \"C\", \"G\", \"J\"]\nsustainable = [\"E\", \"H\", \"K\"]\nrequirements = [(\"G\", \"B\"), (\"J\", \"E\"), (\"K\", \"C\")]\nincompatibilities = [(\"D\", \"H\"), (\"F\", \"L\")]\nsynergies = {(\"A\", \"C\"): 12, (\"E\", \"K\"): 10}\n\nenv = gp.Env(empty=True)\nenv.setParam(\"OutputFlag\", 0)\nenv.start()\n\nmodel = gp.Model(\"H05_portafoglio_pluriennale\", env=env)\n\nx = {\n    i: model.addVar(vtype=GRB.BINARY, name=\"x_\" + i)\n    for i in P\n}\n\ny = {\n    pair: model.addVar(\n        vtype=GRB.BINARY,\n        name=\"y_\" + pair[0] + pair[1]\n    )\n    for pair in synergies\n}\n\nmodel.setObjective(\n    gp.quicksum(van[i] * x[i] for i in P)\n    + gp.quicksum(synergies[pair] * y[pair] for pair in synergies),\n    GRB.MAXIMIZE\n)\n\nfor t in T:\n    model.addConstr(\n        gp.quicksum(cost[i][t] * x[i] for i in P) <= budget[t],\n        name=\"budget_A\" + str(t)\n    )\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(personnel[i] * x[i] for i in P) <= 28,\n    name=\"personale\"\n)\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(risk[i] * x[i] for i in P) <= 32,\n    name=\"rischio\"\n)\n\nfor project, prerequisite in requirements:\n    model.addConstr(\n        x[project] <= x[prerequisite],\n        name=\"requisito_\" + project + \"_\" + prerequisite\n    )\n\nfor i, j in incompatibilities:\n    model.addConstr(\n        x[i] + x[j] <= 1,\n        name=\"incompatibilita_\" + i + \"_\" + j\n    )\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(x[i] for i in digital) >= 2,\n    name=\"minimo_digitali\"\n)\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(x[i] for i in sustainable) >= 1,\n    name=\"minimo_sostenibili\"\n)\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(x[i] for i in P) <= 8,\n    name=\"massimo_progetti\"\n)\n\nfor i, j in synergies:\n    model.addConstr(y[(i, j)] <= x[i], name=\"sinergia_up1_\" + i + j)\n    model.addConstr(y[(i, j)] <= x[j], name=\"sinergia_up2_\" + i + j)\n    model.addConstr(\n        y[(i, j)] >= x[i] + x[j] - 1,\n        name=\"sinergia_low_\" + i + j\n    )\n\nmodel.optimize()\n\nstatus_names = {\n    1: \"LOADED\",\n    2: \"OPTIMAL\",\n    3: \"INFEASIBLE\",\n    4: \"INF_OR_UNBD\",\n    5: \"UNBOUNDED\",\n    6: \"CUTOFF\",\n    7: \"ITERATION_LIMIT\",\n    8: \"NODE_LIMIT\",\n    9: \"TIME_LIMIT\",\n    10: \"SOLUTION_LIMIT\",\n    11: \"INTERRUPTED\",\n    12: \"NUMERIC\",\n    13: \"SUBOPTIMAL\",\n    14: \"INPROGRESS\",\n    15: \"USER_OBJ_LIMIT\",\n    16: \"WORK_LIMIT\",\n    17: \"MEM_LIMIT\"\n}\n\nstatus_code = int(model.Status)\nstatus_name = status_names.get(status_code, str(status_code))\n\nif status_code == GRB.OPTIMAL:\n    variables = {}\n    for i in P:\n        variables[x[i].VarName] = float(round(x[i].X))\n    for pair in synergies:\n        variables[y[pair].VarName] = float(round(y[pair].X))\n\n    payload = {\n        \"status\": \"OPTIMAL\",\n        \"objective\": float(round(model.ObjVal, 10)),\n        \"variables\": variables\n    }\nelse:\n    payload = {\n        \"status\": status_name,\n        \"objective\": None,\n        \"variables\": {}\n    }\n\nprint(\"SOLUTION_JSON=\" + json.dumps(payload, separators=(\",\", \":\")))\n```\n\n## 4. Breve sintesi della soluzione\n\nLo stato è **OPTIMAL** e il VAN complessivo massimo è:\n\n\\[\nz^*=235.\n\\]\n\nI progetti selezionati sono:\n\n\\[\nA,\\ C,\\ E,\\ H,\\ K.\n\\]\n\nSono attive entrambe le sinergie:\n\n\\[\ny_{AC}=1,\\qquad y_{EK}=1.\n\\]\n\nIl VAN base è \\(213\\), a cui si aggiungono \\(12+10=22\\) di sinergie. I consumi sono: budget \\(109,85,76\\), personale \\(22\\) e rischio \\(25\\).",
